-- Quest log goal line for quests players do on WoW Forever but whose log line (LogDescription) and story text are both empty in
-- our data, so the quest log showed nothing under the title. The line is the quest's objective text as Questie's Forever data has
-- it (Questie team, Questie/QuestieDB, GPLv3, https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB, data/Forever/foreverQuestDB.lua and
-- src/corrections/Forever/, 2026-11-07), two typos fixed (Ogrimmar, thise). Only fills an empty line; a quest that already has
-- text is left alone. 105 quests: priest racial spell quests, Zul'Gurub enchants, battleground mark quests, Ahn'Qiraj war effort,
-- library book quests and a few more.
-- Also: In Dreams (5944) can be handed in to Tirion Fordring (1855) at his hut as well as to Lord Tirion Fordring (12126), who only
-- shows up during the Hearthglen event; Questie lists both. Safe to run again.

